<%- include('../partials/header') %><main id="main-content" class="container-xl order-page"><div class="cart-heading"><h1>确认取消订单</h1><a class="btn btn-outline-brand" href="<%= orderUrl(order.id,browse) %>">保留订单</a></div><section class="order-card payment-card"><h2>取消这笔未支付订单</h2><p class="order-number"><%= order.orderNo %> · ¥<%= order.total %></p><p class="payment-notice">确认后订单会关闭，并恢复下单时扣减的库存。取消后不可继续支付该订单，历史记录保留。如仍需要商品，请重新选购。</p><form action="<%= orderUrl(order.id,browse,'cancel') %>" method="post" class="payment-actions"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="confirmCancel" value="yes"><button class="btn btn-brand">确认取消订单并恢复库存</button><a class="btn btn-outline-brand" href="<%= orderUrl(order.id,browse) %>">暂不取消</a></form></section></main><%- include('../partials/footer') %>
